SplitArgsModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Splits the Params string on comma (Core.Chr 44): null or empty string → empty list (otherwise StrSplit("") produced a single empty token and parameter counters shifted); non-empty — token list.
    Provides: SplitArgs(pstr) -> parts.
    DependsOn: none (leaf with no dependencies on other modules)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../SplitArgs/SplitArgs.sir).
